              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "a gentileza — \"kindness, courtesy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Foi uma gentileza do vizinho ajudar-nos com as malas. It was kind of the neighbour to help us with the cases."
